{
  "_createdAt": "2026-04-27T18:27:12Z",
  "_id": "wp-post-153089-en",
  "_rev": "dJ4ZpMyfIFtQ0D7lyxWvmx",
  "_type": "article",
  "_updatedAt": "2026-07-05T14:25:10Z",
  "author": {
    "_ref": "author-legacy-archive",
    "_type": "reference"
  },
  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "000000000001",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000000",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Few people want to think about hospitals on an Egypt trip."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000003",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000002",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Heat, stomach issues, falls, traffic accidents, and diving trouble can happen. Knowing where to go, who to call, and when to contact the insurer keeps the response calm."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000005",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "zqsqmtpsww2g",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Egypt has medical care. Quality and ease of use vary a lot by place. Large private hospitals in "
        },
        {
          "_key": "woud96twsbx7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "yle5dkhmll1g"
          ],
          "text": "Cairo"
        },
        {
          "_key": "j0tyq9pqmacf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", public hospitals in the provinces, and Red Sea resort emergency care are not the same."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "yle5dkhmll1g",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-83284",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000007",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000006",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What a traveller needs isn't to memorise hospital names. It is to judge which kind of care to go to from where they are."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000009",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000008",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Numbers to know first"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000000d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000000a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The Egyptian ambulance number is "
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "123"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000017",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000000e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Police is "
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "122"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000010",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", fire "
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000011",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "180"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000012",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", tourist police "
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000013",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "126"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000014",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". On mobiles, "
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000015",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "112"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000016",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " may serve as a general emergency number."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000019",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000018",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Knowing the number isn't the same as help arriving fast. In Cairo, traffic is heavy and ambulances may not move quickly. In the provinces, desert, and outside resorts, response can take longer."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000001b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000001a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "In emergencies, also contact the hotel, guide, driver, tour operator, or dive centre. In Egypt, the people on the spot often help with the first judgment and movement."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000001d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000001c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Public and private hospitals"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000001f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000001e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Egypt has public and private hospitals."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000021",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000020",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Public hospitals are many and costs are relatively low. They play an important role in initial emergency response and basic treatment. Crowding, older facilities, English support, administrative steps, and cleanliness can be loads for foreign travellers."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000023",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "utv0jdshbrb0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Private hospitals cost more but are often easier for travellers. English support, diagnostic equipment, insurance-company correspondence, private rooms, and detailed explanations differ. In Cairo, "
        },
        {
          "_key": "qiqhzwk0vaab",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "5qubai475yol"
          ],
          "text": "Alexandria"
        },
        {
          "_key": "dxd1quv602lt",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "_key": "h8w7whic2myn",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "wvwxyhmlmpwg"
          ],
          "text": "Luxor"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k5h4ynaqdu30",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "_key": "e1ppox8y1z1q",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "83hth4f22r19"
          ],
          "text": "Hurghada"
        },
        {
          "_key": "p6ublo58b9ob",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", Sharm el-Sheikh, and other major cities or tourist areas, thinking of private hospitals first is realistic."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "5qubai475yol",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58750",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "wvwxyhmlmpwg",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58877",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "83hth4f22r19",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58859",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000025",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000024",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "In life-threatening situations, the nearest capable facility takes priority. For mild issues or uncertain symptoms, ask the hotel or insurer and head to a private facility used to foreign patients."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000027",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000026",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Cairo has the most options"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000029",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000028",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Cairo has the most medical options in Egypt."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000002b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000002a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Large private hospitals, university hospitals, specialist clinics, and diagnostic centres. The chance of meeting English-speaking doctors is higher than in the provinces. For complex symptoms or needed inpatient care, moving to Cairo can be the final call."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000002d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ltjmwdn6xr3j",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Even in Cairo, hospital choice depends on location. From Zamalek, Garden City, Maadi, New Cairo, "
        },
        {
          "_key": "h3lrzozdzuj2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "yqxrw0o2l9ba"
          ],
          "text": "Giza"
        },
        {
          "_key": "968k04k5issz",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", and 6th of October City, the nearest hospitals differ. Confirm with the hotel the nearest trusted private hospital."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "yqxrw0o2l9ba",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58854",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000002f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000002e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For serious symptoms, contact the insurer's emergency support early. They judge which hospital to go to, whether to issue a payment guarantee, and whether evacuation is needed."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000031",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5lg868qsseal",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Luxor, "
        },
        {
          "_key": "60g1h8i94psv",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "o69ejbklq7tc"
          ],
          "text": "Aswan"
        },
        {
          "_key": "dvp3whg1p3pg",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", the Red Sea"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "o69ejbklq7tc",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58758",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000033",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000032",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "In Luxor and Aswan, the medical options used by travellers are more limited than in Cairo."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000035",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000034",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Gastroenteritis, heatstroke, minor injuries, IV fluids, basic tests are often manageable locally. For heart, brain, severe trauma, or complex surgery, after stabilisation, moving to Cairo can be the call."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000037",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9hfe34f462m9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "On the Red Sea in Hurghada, "
        },
        {
          "_key": "g8jcrrdt9fuq",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "meui43tfqzw5"
          ],
          "text": "El Gouna"
        },
        {
          "_key": "9oyt62d8orl7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", Sharm el-Sheikh, and "
        },
        {
          "_key": "xbpplhdg44zn",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "72pyek6si48u"
          ],
          "text": "Dahab"
        },
        {
          "_key": "i85ur5iy8ky6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", sea-related care matters especially. After diving, abnormal fatigue, numbness, dizziness, joint pain, breathlessness, or vision changes can indicate decompression sickness. Don't see it as rest needed. Contact the dive centre, emergency services, or hyperbaric facility immediately."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "meui43tfqzw5",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58740",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "72pyek6si48u",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-59436",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000039",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000038",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The Red Sea has facilities with recompression chambers for diving incidents. Divers should confirm the nearest chamber and emergency procedure before diving."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000003b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000003a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Pharmacies are quite useful"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000003d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000003c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "In Egypt, pharmacies are very practical for travellers."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000003f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000003e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Major cities and tourist areas have many pharmacies, and pharmacists can advise on mild symptoms. For stomach issues, sunburn, insect bites, mild skin reactions, cold symptoms, and mild pain, the pharmacy can solve before the hospital."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000041",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000040",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Medicines that need a prescription in Europe, North America, or Japan can sometimes be bought relatively easily at a pharmacy in Egypt. Don't self-prescribe antibiotics excessively. People with chronic conditions, pregnant women, children, older travellers, and those with strong symptoms should consult a doctor, not only the pharmacy."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000043",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000042",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For regular medication, carry a note with the English generic name, dose, and condition. Photos of medication boxes and prescriptions help too."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000045",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000044",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Travel insurance is needed"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000047",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000046",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Basic medical costs in Egypt can be lower than in Japan, Europe, or North America."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000049",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000048",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "That doesn't mean travel insurance is unnecessary. The issue isn't only consultation fees but hospitalisation, surgery, ambulance, medical air evacuation, and treatment after return. Moving from Luxor or Aswan to Cairo, or medical evacuation from Egypt to home country, costs add up quickly."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000004b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000004a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "When choosing insurance, confirm beyond medical fees — emergency evacuation, family-support costs, 24-hour Japanese or English support, and diving and desert-activity coverage."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000004d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000004c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Before departure, save the insurer's emergency contacts in your phone and on paper. Searching for documents while unwell is very hard."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000004f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000004e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Common symptoms"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000051",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000050",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What travellers see most are stomach issues, dehydration, heat exhaustion, sunburn, insect bites, and foot injuries."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000053",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000052",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Don't drink tap water; use bottled. In hot-season Luxor and Aswan, see sites in the morning and rest at midday. Headache, nausea, light-headedness, strong fatigue — stop the schedule and move to a cool place."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000055",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000054",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "You don't need to avoid stalls or local eateries; be careful with things kept hot for long, things possibly washed in raw water, and ice. With strong stomach issues, blood in stool, high fever, or progressing dehydration, go to a medical facility, not only the pharmacy."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000057",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000056",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "At sites, watch foot placement too. Falls on old stone, sand, steps, and landings aren't rare. Choose walking shoes and move slowly especially when heat drops concentration."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000059",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000058",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How to move in emergencies"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000005b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000005a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For serious symptoms or accidents, first move to a safe place."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000005f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000005c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If an ambulance is needed, "
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000005d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "123"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000005e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". At the same time, contact hotel, guide, driver, tour operator, and insurer. If you can choose the hospital, prioritise private hospitals used to foreign patients in major cities."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000061",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000060",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Going to the hospital, take passport, insurance information, cash, credit card, and medication information. If possible, have Arabic-speaking staff or guide accompany for paperwork."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000063",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000062",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For suspected diving incidents, before going to a normal hospital, contact the dive centre or recompression chamber immediately. Time matters."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000065",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000064",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "In sum"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000067",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000066",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Egyptian medical care varies by place."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000069",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000068",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Cairo has options. Luxor and Aswan can handle basics; complex cases may need transfer. The Red Sea needs diving-incident preparation especially. Pharmacies help but have limits."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000006b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000006a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
